<title>SINGAPORE: Provisions Suppliers 1st half rises 72pct.</title>
<headline>Provisions Suppliers 1st half rises 72pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   3.83   vs    2.23</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		2.90   vs    1.69</p>
<p>    Turnover			    74.53   vs   70.00</p>
<p>    Investment and other income    1.87   vs    1.49</p>
<p>    Share of results of		2.97   vs    1.32</p>
<p>associates</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     5.53   vs    3.44</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.86   vs    1.22</p>
<p>    Minorities		 (gain)  0.17   vs    0.01 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Provisions Suppliers Corp Ltd, a household consumer products company, said shareholders had approved a previously announced one-for-five bonus share issue and one-for-two rights issue.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
